      "role": "assistant",
      "reasoning": "The learner is close but still includes the mean. I need to correct the list to: Minimum, Q1, Median, Q3, and Maximum. [TOOL CHECK: calculator(expression=\"(131+133)/2\") -> 132.0]",
      "content": "Not quite. The mean isn't part of the five-number summary. The summary consists of the minimum value, the first quartile (Q1), the median, the third quartile (Q3), and the maximum value. Looking at the data set of 20 numbers, can you identify the minimum and the maximum?"
