      "content": "The intelligence quotient score (IQ) of a Grade 10 class is summarised in the table below.\n\n| IQ INTERVAL | FREQUENCY |\n| :---: | :---: |\n| 90 <= x < 100 | 4 |\n| 100 <= x < 110 | 8 |\n| 110 <= x < 120 | 7 |\n| 120 <= x < 130 | 5 |\n| 130 <= x < 140 | 4 |\n| 140 <= x < 150 | 2 |\n\nEstimate the mean IQ score of this class of learners."
