      "content": "I need help with this analytical geometry question: In the diagram, ADCB is a kite with A(3; 5) and B(-1; -4). AD = DC and AB = BC. AD is parallel to the x-axis and AD = 5 units. CD is perpendicular to the x-axis. Calculate the area of the kite ADCB."
